:"","alternative":[{"codice":"sqj-pro","nome":"Proto-Albanian","termine":"*stana","categoria":"non_precisato"},{"codice":"ine-pro","nome":"Proto-Indo-European","termine":"","categoria":"non_precisato"},{"codice":"xdc","nome":"Dacian","termine":"","categoria":"non_precisato"},{"codice":"qfa-sub","nome":"substrate","termine":"","categoria":"non_precisato"}],"testo":"From Old Albanian shtanse, from *shtan + -zë, from Proto-Albanian *stana, from Proto-Indo-European *sth₂-nó-s (“standing”), participle of *steh₂- (“to stand”). Ultimately a doublet of stër-. Alternatively, from Dacian or Paleo-Balkan substrate, cognate to Romanian stână."}]}